# @name settleSavingsInterest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/portfolio/portfolios/{{createPortfolio.response.body.id}}/savings-accounts/{{addSavingsAccount.response.body.assetId}}/interest-settlements
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
